OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny spells. There will also be
OL,7,Fa few showers. WInds will be a fresh
OL,8,Fto strong south to southwest winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FThere will be a mixture of
OL,11,Foccasional showers and some clearer
OL,12,Finterludes this evening and tonight.
OL,13,FFresh to strong southerly winds easing
OL,14,Fslightly.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FRather cloudy morning for
OL,17,FOrkney with a few showers. Drier
OL,18,Fsunnier conditions over Shetland will
OL,19,Fthen spread south into Orkney in the
OL,20,Fafternoon. Moderate southeasterly
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
