OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday dry with some sunny spells.
OL,7,FThursday cloudier with rain spreading
OL,8,Ffrom the west. Brighter again on
OL,9,FFriday with sunny spells.
